          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">Once per turning point, when this operative inflicts damage on an enemy operative with either profile of its hand flamer, if that enemy operative wasn&apos;t incapacitated, you can use this rule. If you do, you can select one friendly CELESTIAN INSIDIANT operative within 6&quot; of this operative to become **INSPIRING**.</characteristic>
