          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">Whenever determining control of a marker, treat the total APL stat of enemy operatives that contest it as 1 lower if at least one of those enemy operatives is within 3&quot; of this operative. Note this isn&apos;t a change to the APL stat, so any changes are cumulative with this.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Devotion" id="16d3-555f-8f4f-86e0" hidden="false" typeId="f887-5881-0e6d-755c" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">At the end of each of this operative&apos;s activations, if it&apos;s **INSPIRING** and it controls an objective marker or one of your mission markers, one friendly CELESTIAN INSIDIANT operative this operative is visible to and within 6&quot; of becomes **INSPIRING**.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
